New PlayClaw build 3583 is ready to download!
This new build contains a few bug fixes and a new cool feature - Chroma Key for Webcam overlay. This feature is released as paid DLC and available here http://store.steampowered.com/app/470500

For existing PlayClaw users we give Chroma Key DLC license for free until 23:59 GMT+3, 26 May 2016. Just post your request in comments (ex. "want DLC" and we will answer with free key(s) ).

Here is the list of other changes:

Fixed error writing files when no audio sources is selected;
Fixed very low fps during capture on some systems in DX9 and OpenGL games;
Increased speed of OpenGL capture (about 10%);


Chroma Key for PlayClaw tutorial
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GPO-06dmrmY

